Report introduced. \n (Convention floor: Kate Snow)  Edwards' speech tonight previewed; details given of his ability to connect with middle class voters; scenes shown of Edwards testing the podium late last night.  [Political analyst Stuart ROTHENBERG&nbsp- says this is a sales job for Edwards to dispel questions about his capabilities.]  [EDWARDS&nbsp- comments on his law practice.]", "segment_duration": 330, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63050.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760882, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "Cyhr93yqSe", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-28", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760881, "segment_id": "W6xT04fc6S", "segment_broadcast_id": "Cyhr93yqSe", "segment_title": "Iraq / Attacks / The Violence", "segment_description": "(Boston: Peter Jennings)  Report introduced.   (Iraq: Mike Lee)  A massive suicide bombing at a police station in Baqubah, Iraq, featured; scenes shown of fire, smoke, victims, witnesses, damages & from the hospital; details given of the new pattern of insurgent tactics; statistics cited of American & Iraqi casualties.   (Boston: Peter Jennings)  The death of four more US soldiers & of seven Iraqi policemen killed in a raid on insurgents & the execution of two Pakistani hostages reported.   (Pentagon: Martha Raddatz)  The military's assessment of the patterns of violence in Iraq featured; scenes shown from Baqubah.  [US Central Command commander Gen. John ABIZAID\u00a0- says a lot of Iraqis are sitting on the fence.]", "segment_duration": 200, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63380.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760883, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "Cyhr93yqSe", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-28", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760881, "segment_id": "3r35AKES7Z", "segment_broadcast_id": "Cyhr93yqSe", "segment_title": "Afghanistan / Doctors Without Borders", "segment_description": "(Boston: Peter Jennings)  Announcement from the group Doctors Without Borders that it is leaving Afghanistan because of safety concerns reported; details given of the explosion of a bomb outside a mosque killing U.N. workers.", "segment_duration": 40, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63580.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760884, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "Cyhr93yqSe", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-28", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760881, "segment_id": "gkTid0skUX", "segment_broadcast_id": "Cyhr93yqSe", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items (Boston: Peter Jennings)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 30, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63620.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760885, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "Cyhr93yqSe", "broa